# Pinned dependency versions for Dockerfile.windows
# Edit this file to bump versions, then rebuild with: .\build-docker.ps1 -Windows
# Each ARG is placed immediately before its RUN in the Dockerfile so only the
# changed layer (and everything after it) is invalidated on rebuild.
# Last verified: 2026-10-24

